<title>FRANCE: G. Eaux, Havas shares suspended.</title>
<headline>G. Eaux, Havas shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in Generale des Eaux and Havas shares will be suspended on Thursday ahead of a statement, the French stock exchanges association (SBF) said.</p>
<p>The two companies are due to hold a joint news conference at 1530 GMT.</p>
<p>They said on Monday they were set to make an announcement on their interests in the audiovisual industry, notably their stakes in Canal Plus.</p>
</text>
